## Permissions
This route requires the following permission: `company.prices.read`

#### Response

Returns the desired company currency settings.

```json Response example
[
  {
    "setting": "CURRENCY_CODE",
    "company": "fb275395-325c-4033-9824-1bb95763b620",
    "value": "EUR"
  },
  {
    "setting": "CURRENCY_DECIMAL_NUMBER",
    "company": "fb275395-325c-4033-9824-1bb95763b620",
    "value": "2"
  },
  {
    "setting": "CURRENCY_SYMBOL",
    "company": "fb275395-325c-4033-9824-1bb95763b620",
    "value": "€"
  }
]
```

post.description:
## Permissions
This route requires the following permission: `store.seating-plan.write`

#### Body
Create a new room.
```json Body example
{
  "name": "Room A",
  "tables": [
    {
      "name": "Table 1",
      "number": 1,
      "cutlery": 2
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Response
Returns the created room.
```json Response example
{
    "id": "06ffa802-06a7-4350-9f3f-46a4e577575b",
    "name": "Room A",
    "tables": [{
        "id": "06ffa802-06a7-4350-9f3f-46a4e577575b",
        "name": "Table 1",
        "number": 1,
        "cutlery": 2
    }]
}
```

