## Permissions
This route requires the following permission: `store.stocks.read`

#### Response

Returns the products weight of a store

```json Response example
{
  "items": [
    {
      "item": "edd0e697-f8c2-43e7-8af0-d662d0d48da7",
      "weight": 30
    },
    {
      "item": "4042e64c-b186-445e-b485-28114b5517d5",
      "weight": 0
    }
  ],
  "hasNextPage": false,
  "skipped": 0
}
```
